      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu adalah dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "seksyen 22 seksyen yang berikut: \"Certificate 22A. Notwithstanding anything contained in any of Director other written law or rule of evidence to the General admissible contrary, where in any proceedings a document in purporting to be a certificate under the hand of evidence. the Director General in respect of a decision made by him under section 13B or 22 is produced, such document shall be admissible in evidence and shall be accepted as sufficient evidence of the facts therein stated and the Director General shall not be required to give evidence in respect of such decision unless the court otherwise orders. 4 RANG UNDANG-UNDANG Recovery 22B. Without prejudice to any other remedy, of customs any customs duty payable under this Act may duty as a civil debt. be recovered by the Minister as a civil debt due to the Government of Malaysia, or where the customs duty is a duty of a category assigned to the State by Article 112c of the Federal Constitution, to the Government of that State.\". Pindaan"
      }
