      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/4/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu adalah dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas baru 9A. seksyen 9 seksyen yang berikut: \"Unlawful 9A. Any person, not being an officer of customs, use, who unlawfully wears, uses, possesses or possession, etc. of displays otherwise than in the course of a stage uniform, play or other theatrical performance, any etc. prescribed uniform or badge or authority card, or any dress having the appearance of or bearing the distinctive marks of such uniform shall be guilty of an offence under this Act.\". Pemotongan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/4/msa@/~cl_7",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
