      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/4/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 11 Akta ibu adalah dipinda dengan memotong subseksyen subseksyen (6). 11(6). Pindaan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/4/msa@/~cl_8",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "8",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/4/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu adalah dipinda dengan menggantikan seksyen 13. subseksyen 13(1) dengan subseksyen yang berikut: \"CIassifi- 13. (1) The proper officer of customs may, in cation and respect of any dutiable or uncustomed goods,— valuation by proper (a) determine the class of goods to which officer of customs. such dutiable or uncustomed goods belong; and KASTAM (PINDAAN) (b) value, weigh, measure or otherwise examine, or cause to be valued, weighed, measured or otherwise examined such dutiable or uncustomed goods, for the purpose of ascertaining the customs duty leviable thereon.\"."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/4/msa@/~cl_9",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "9",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/4/msa@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu adalah dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "seksyen 13 seksyen yang berikut: \"Payment 13A. Any person who is dissatisfied with a of customs decision of a proper officer of customs under duty under protest. section 13(1) as to whether any particular goods are or are not included in a class of goods appearing in an order made under section 11(1) or with the valuation, weighing, measuring or examining of any goods may pay the customs duty Ievied under protest. Director 13B. Where customs duty has been paid under General to protest, the proper officer of customs shall, within determine thirty days of such payment being made, refer questions on classifi- any question as to classification or valuation cation and of goods to the Director General for his valuation. decision.\"."
      }
